# Store all secrets in Doppler, not in .env
# Configure via Doppler CLI: doppler secrets download

# Required secrets in Doppler:
# - TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN (from @BotFather)
# - TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID (your Telegram chat ID)
# - OPENAI_API_KEY (from OpenAI for GPT-4o)

# Optional (for currency monitor):
# - WEATHER_API_KEY (if switching from open-meteo)
